# PNJC Liquidity Locker V2

PNJC Liquidity Locker V2 is an immutable smart contract for locking Uniswap V2 LP tokens.

## Important
This contract is NOT an ERC-20 PNJC token contract.
It does NOT mint, burn, or manage PNJC supply.

The contract only accepts, holds, and releases Uniswap V2 LP tokens after a predefined unlock time.

## Security model
- No owner
- No admin
- No upgradeability
- No emergency withdrawal
- No rescue functions
- Reentrancy protection
- Deterministic unlock logic

## Supported asset type
- Uniswap V2 LP token (ERC-20)

## Public interface
- lock(amount, beneficiary, unlockTime)
- withdraw(lockId)
- version()
- contractVersion()
- positionManager()
- lockStatus(lockId)
- timeRemaining(lockId)
- isLocked(lockId)
- isUnlocked(lockId)
- isWithdrawn(lockId)
- getLock(lockId)

## Audit notes
The contract follows a simple custody model:
LP tokens are transferred into the contract, held until unlock, and then released only to the beneficiary.
